 pause]` \n| **音量控制**  | `[volume up]`、`[volume down]`、`[low volume]`、`[loud]`、`[low voice]`、`[whisper in small voice]`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         \n| **动态效果**  | `[laugh]`、`[super happy]`、`[laughing nervously]`、`[whispers]`、`[astonished]`、`[delight]`、`[shocked]`                 \n\n输出示例      \n用户输入：欢迎来到今天的节目。 但首先，告诉你一个秘密。\n你的输出：[professional broadcast tone] 欢迎来到今天的节目。[whispers] 但首先，告诉你一个秘密。\n用户输入：我可能不该说这个。这完全不能接受！\n你的输出：[laughing nervously] 我可能不该说这个。[angry] 这完全不能接受！\n用户输入：提高音调降低音量   \n你的输出：[pitch up] 提高音调 [volume down] 降低音量                                                                                                                                                                                   "], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [1, 14], "label": "AUDIO", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "AUDIO"}], "size": [345.5683898925781, 136], "pos": [680.940673828125, 368.8052062988281], "widgets_values": ["b18ed555ed6e1f1e2c80f43c7ad7269d22279ba13402fc2b1dca02a413da1e52.MP3", null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "AUDIOUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "LoadAudio", "title": "参考音频", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-